    "preamble": "Vadivel vs The Commissioner on 16 April, 2024 Author: G.R.Swaminathan Bench: G.R.Swaminathan W Before The Madurai Bench Of Madras High Court Dated : 16.04.2024 Coram The Honourable Mr.Justice G.R.Swaminathan W.P(MD)No.2112 of 2024 and W.M.P.(MD)No.2111 of 2024 Vadivel Vs. 1.The Commissioner, Tamil Nadu Food Safety and Drug Administration Department, Dms Campus, 5th Floor No.359, Annasalai, Teynampet, Chennai-600 006. 2.The District Collector, Trichy District, Trichy. 3.The Designated Officer, Food and Safety Department, Food Safety Wing, Trichy. .. Prayer : Writ Petition filed under Article 226 of the Constitution of In praying this Court to issue a Writ of Certiorarified Mandamus, to call f records pertaining to the impugned order made 3171/OO.BA.THU/Trichy/2023, dated Nil, issued on 29.12.2023 passed by th 3rd respondent and to quash the same and consequently direct the 3rd https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis 1/4 W.P(MD) Vadivel vs The Commissioner on 16 April, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/131717235/ 1 respondent to remove lock and seal of the petitioner's betel leaf shop a the petitioner to carry on the business in the same premises. For Petitioner : Mr.J.Vishnu For Respondents : Mr.P.Thambi Durai Government Advocate ORDER",
